rn.\"","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"50:4","t":"We know what the earth diminishes [i.e., consumes] of them, and with Us is a retaining record.","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"50:5","t":"But they denied the truth when it came to them, so they are in a confused condition.","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"50:6","t":"Have they not looked at the heaven above them - how We structured it and adorned it and [how] it has no rifts?","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"50:7","t":"And the earth - We spread it out and cast therein firmly set mountains and made grow therein [something] of every beautiful kind,","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"50:8","t":"Giving insight and a reminder for every servant who turns [to Allāh].","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"50:9","t":"And We have sent down blessed rain from the sky and made grow thereby gardens and grain from the harvest","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"50:10","t":"And lofty palm trees having fruit arranged in layers -","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"50:11","t":"As provision for the servants, and We have given life thereby to a dead land. Thus is the emergence [i.e., resurrection].","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"50:12","t":"The people of Noah denied before them, and the companions of the well and Thamūd","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"50:13","t":"And ʿAad and Pharaoh and the brothers [i.e., people] of Lot","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"50:14","t":"And the companions of the thicket and the people of Tubbaʿ. All denied the messengers, so My threat was justly fulfilled.","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"50:15","t":"Did We fail in the first creation? But they are in confusion over a new creation.","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":15,"sd":null}],"juz":26,"hizb":52,"surahs":[50],"sajdah":false}